v aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/75 via-black/30 to-transparent px-4 pb-4 pt-16 text-white transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] md:px-5 md:translate-y-[54px] md:opacity-90 md:transition-[transform,opacity] md:group-hover:translate-y-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100\"><p class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/60\" style=\"margin-right:-0.3em\">05<!-- --> — <!-- -->Pendants</p><h3 class=\"mt-1.5 text-lg font-light tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap md:text-xl\">Eclipse</h3><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-500 ease-out md:grid-rows-[0fr] md:group-hover:grid-rows-[1fr]\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"max-w-[280px] text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-white/75\">A razor-thin black disc with a polished core — light as a fine line.</p><p class=\"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/90\">More details<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></p></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1400px] flex-col gap-4 px-5 pb-20 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-10 md:pb-28\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-neutral-400\">Swipe — every piece waits inside</p><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-900 \" href=\"/products\"><span class=\"border-b pb-1 transition-colors border-neutral-900/25 group-hover:border-neutral-900\">The full collection</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></a></div></section><section id=\"scene\" aria-label=\"The fittings in situ\" class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-white/40\" style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">02 — In situ</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-extralight leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">One room, seven<br/>Batolite <em class=\"font-serif font-light italic\">pieces.</em></h2></div><p class=\"max-w-sm text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/50 md:pb-2 md:text-sm\">Four Tubes graze the kitchen wall, a pair of Flutes pools light over the island, Eclipse floats above the table — the exact fittings you switched in the showroom, rendered at full light.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\"><figure class=\"mt-12 md:mt-16\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10\"><div data-protected=\"true\" class=\"relative select-none overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] w-full sm:aspect-[16/9] lg:aspect-[1.9]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 bg-neutral-900 opacity-100\"></div><canvas role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The Batolite reference apartment fully lit — four Tube wall cylinders, a pair of Flute pendants over the island and the Eclipse disc above the living table\" class=\"block h-full w-full\"></canvas><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/35 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><span>The reference apartment — every fitting on.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-px flex-1 bg-white/10 md:mx-6 md:block\"></span><span>Batolite · Tube / Flute / Eclipse</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section id=\"atelier\" aria-label=\"The atelier\" class=\"bg-white text-neutral-900\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"reveal \"><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">03 — The Atelier</p><blockquote class=\"mt-8 border-l border-neutral-900/20 pl-6 md:pl-8\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light italic leading-[1.2] text-neutral-900 md:text-[2.6rem] md:leading-[1.15]\">“We don’t decorate rooms. We compose their light.”</p></blockquote></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"transition-delay:100ms\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 md:text-base\">Every Batolite piece begins as a drawing of light, not of a lamp — a study of where the glow should land and what it should leave in shadow. From that study the fixture follows: cylinders spun in metal, cones cast in concrete, a disc ground to a razor-thin edge. Nothing is added that does not serve the light.</p><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 md:text-base\">The palette stays deliberately monochrome — chalk, graphite, raw concrete — so each piece reads as quiet architecture by day and steps forward after dark, when a warm 2700 K source takes over. Every fitting is made to order in the atelier and bench-tested before it leaves.</p></div><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"transition-delay:180ms\"><dl class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-8 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-10 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><dt class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light md:text-4xl\">03</dt><dd class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"margin-right:-0.26em\">Families of light</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><dt class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light md:text-4xl\">05</dt><dd class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"margin-right:-0.26em\">Pieces, one language</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><dt class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light md:text-4xl\">2700 K</dt><dd class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"margin-right:-0.26em\">Warm dim source</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><dt class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light md:text-4xl\">CRI 90+</dt><dd class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-neutral-400\" style=\"margin-right:-0.26em\">Colour honesty</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white text-neutral-900\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-14 md:px-10 md:py-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0\"><path d=\"M12 2.5v6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6.75 13.25C6.75 10.9 9.1 9 12 9s5.25 1.9 5.25 4.25H6.75Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.55\"></circle></svg><span class=\"leading-none text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[0.42em]\" style=\"margin-right:-0.42em\">BATOLITE</span></span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-500\">Sculpted light for contemporary spaces — made to order in the atelier, bench-tested before it leaves.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Footer\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/products\">Products</a><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900\" href=\"/about#contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"mailto:hello@batolite.com\" class=\"text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-500 transition